# No environment variables are required to run this app.
# All Supabase connection credentials are stored client-side in localStorage via Zustand persist.
# Add your connections directly in the app UI.

# For the Data Catalog AI feature, deploy the catalog-generator edge function to your Supabase
# project and set your OpenAI API key as a Supabase secret:
#   supabase functions deploy catalog-generator
#   supabase secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
